  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c10a37b803ec0e8de20ad92e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经决定了……\r\n无论何时，都不会放弃梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ebaf8df7a28d6029461f952320c8a7246338bebfd55b78b571888e388462a18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5cc2f6700ee008d054207d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算一切不尽如理想──\r\n但我还是……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bef5c7206b07fc8bc693287f214b05eab443fd5832b374b3de762941e565022b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:951c759e13f4d80d50b66a37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勇于挑战虽然重要……\r\n但不是应该要视时机和状况而定吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7424bb70d2f673370a131b7c78dec5b97f05239dff51bfc4892747aa3ccfd453",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c549a64d75c4b28d4f13c84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "极限已经近在眼前了……\r\n所以我们就别再勉强了吧。\r\n毕竟可不能够失去梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ba56465c0ca69782d6fa22babae483420b304d27eef5af415689761a46336f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a02537e201dde42b3ce6281f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我今天就会在这里！\r\n让我与你的梦想绽放──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ac497e0fb18e5a655735a57da711c6f49801948b9e0f6af65d832a4235fe4b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a80ab44876c4810482870c29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这双脚将会如彗星般，\r\n迅速且耀眼地绽放出光芒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e59f5348af0959a2fea500dc3345d78afb60bdbfed496e7412c297d7c7fc47a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27981d53dedf3ad122d73ff2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天感觉会是非常美好的一天……！\r\n呵呵，好开心啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "618e48dd001f452abafc9c17e5c836b8a1a59aa3db4ae780c50f07a5bac6aa87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52115958b350a13c46b2b20f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就让我们全力奔赴至天空的彼端──\r\n奔赴至彩虹那遥远的尽头吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb22c052a8cc18b23d36b4bca982141dfdd3ee71ffaa649514d69ba7350c42d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fe501bea7a3c3b90f02dcec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会在你眼前展现出彷佛要\r\n划破天际的闪电跑姿！",
      "source_fingerprint": "06db812f34f24f28a9227ca0d3c572ff9277ad2e6c7b5a99072be07c8ea290fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2fd7fb9707de2eb13f04e9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "期待又兴奋……！\r\n对比赛的情感高昂了起来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e590cf3aec61f0a627bada564f5a3481861554aaf12beea7ae71f51f7b8b42eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0f1b3ec33e688052b31a839",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我这就去细细品味\r\n可以跑步的幸福啰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ca0f9073e59e1a66c9adf3a75f784cdae32ee10116173e83ea6c99b180223f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30cf631d063a4ef8ff187de7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我所做的种种准备，\r\n希望能让大家看到成果♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1fdc2db1d48ef2e6e242530e6bf453639518c5da145b65f1e6196f91adc2bc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3b51f042ae432ac088b6171",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们可是跨越了许多难关，\r\n才终于来到了这里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28b4883b74603f45d16766baa72fc13a2a745aa56ecc833ee44ce3365cc8ed0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d1427dad2b41c4c86cc99ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "樱花会在度过冬天后绽放……\r\n所以此刻……正是承受严寒之时……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b9552729f4bb5071dfc818a70ab2df2079c50a2d1e2905ecf4887a9e5c3e51c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c423fed06b1292274bf0f9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不放弃，不气馁……\r\n因为我已经下定决心，\r\n有朝一日要盛开了嘛……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ef53a982569cd3317755189976da5d27e8809dc8b9a5bd11e59122932e0898e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23ecd28c17d6b800c87702c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要向前奔驰，\r\n一定会顺利的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d1488f1aa07aff77125ac80fb8b622b7e47232792f1f1932af9a610e96fdbfa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4aad0d7915e38063677502d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别担心……毕竟我们也是\r\n跨越了许多难关才来到这里……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bed9c77f38f85c10e4a9f3c8d51ff11445a4754eca5c5089b3b60e3b07845b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5525cc90640bd7540245970",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可以将挫折转变为力量才对……\r\n一定、一定可以──",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfbcaa53ff0477cf485c0a75f9eb37645bdf73925fb7161b1ab679765e1ede55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b35411ac11ad70c73f17bdaf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我绝不会迷失梦想……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce46eec948b4fcb5be457932551f373dc5aa21b56795e60790a39b03d107f50b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cea7cc534c44ac10a2a7415",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49672a086a169b187b16a389c63cf25fceada147d32b3aa866520c2b922fd86c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f467d834a40f1fd29c22e3ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我上场了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "092de8b679dc1d62be9d0345f00b41ce5d39669391cc434ea8f1c32929be88df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f69c6ba9e50a248f17cb9e2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "29a21b1f6705df3343c2ee4494ea67c6ac1a5e3ea85927d236953a0d6199b613",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f1f8414bebd1b1cd8a1d139",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么？我看看？",
      "source_fingerprint": "947a61a326137f08d9c1308f87ce7645dda9b43c570c0d770259fc228a43aefa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d90074b758cffb7861c6c4ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1f2a9a5a1e05d555bc7af37f0ab33049a63f5cfb0ff24f105db1b188d695d7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1025b5eba03a553fdde2e29e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbe9b8a6562528c71dac2f35e4bb3503757fd80fd15a323c0f3842922f08e2da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad17d8f53195241a8e019608",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们走吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b58d964d17854a803d16140a894079104ae8c9281e306d5f49a7ec42fc0837d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5bb1240f01d09890310d07b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我好期待♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "36aa89ee76f4ab99971d55ae18e744fc15ea47a204418378ffeb44b7e36a21bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a43c883e5963290615ee6b6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多亏了你，我好像能迎来春天了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "981bf762f56eec2a51c6d7a65d0b3b7909f66d95ee1b33f543398fd4c02ffb2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a288c6d2e1b9cfa3b41f1308",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢你让我每天都很开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f50d1e9883beeaec74ef826046b8a4ae46126bf92ff5599e057975a33a1a68d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f4f5dd92ad0a37a4dfcd586",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起加油吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8266583a1fff002ecf06cd04c75efa92925fc077094268f9d687ee79a99659d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b17b41887f7d4d697884df5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备OK！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b04c637281af4c4ae28629441a224cbd0e1ff354e787f2cd5db4b972cb7bee9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:417826ca38dcbbb0f5a02433",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目标是胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78cbd14bfd0bea01a0741c5cff1fe5b7f405cfc7971980eb15f46a1c63b0c4de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c4932d1d94fe4464f7998fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢你让我每天都很开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f50d1e9883beeaec74ef826046b8a4ae46126bf92ff5599e057975a33a1a68d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94bdfaecd7801d29bcd343a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "期待又兴奋……！\r\n对比赛的情感高昂了起来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e590cf3aec61f0a627bada564f5a3481861554aaf12beea7ae71f51f7b8b42eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4630d93b599acbcf292c908f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天感觉会是非常美好的一天……！\r\n呵呵，好开心啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "618e48dd001f452abafc9c17e5c836b8a1a59aa3db4ae780c50f07a5bac6aa87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e16abef81fd98cc8cae33337",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢你让我每天都很开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f50d1e9883beeaec74ef826046b8a4ae46126bf92ff5599e057975a33a1a68d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b313120e985fd370bdfd8b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よーし！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e548208329c219ba46218e46dc381f3a2964dbf221f890a7ff2ac40af246165a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7de25d4fbaa93584e9a25e87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只差一片花瓣了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b50a2aae42e6b29fa39addcc30dfdc2230b72f98963578a1e6eb5a7f9261baae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48fa8284fb87edf0137375a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当成踏出下一步的阶梯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a48ce7b1e8bf70dbc518d30b59382bfefe8d21fe88324390163a682dc64bced7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04d6d48e16ca583091b95c77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得重新审视该反省的地方……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63484ea51f91c0f9d18ea18bc80ab2868b2535054b07eac9fba3c11041b9e5f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ceae7ee18352db262c1c2b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哪怕此刻离樱花的季节──\r\n还很遥远……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "65326af078835f516c12b0b0f14b014ddf870ed85448cb1d3cb58b02e3a0d6d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a82b7edd02f94c17da6b94eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "越过任何凛冽的冬天并绽放，\r\n才称得上是樱花！",
      "source_fingerprint": "daff26b918ea99dd5379e5814fd82bce88c30d9a8fc691136f214339e00606e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c68a892c70680d1d34efb30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是段幸福的时光！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f170f00ddfcd87cdcd98fbff1e31bff5a66254d0a75bbfc787f86531cbe9d6ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:569a3a99b0c8eccb6276d1d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就要开始了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a5b155aafd7a9e84f7e849d8362fa3bc8906126b4ab1965bdde454300b37c28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15d0b59c98ebfd7e19e7ee4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "越过冬天，我就会盛开！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14d60d964f0f365d6f9af91e47f3d6ea202b8e4c6dc8533c617c05357da9b2e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f7cdc11c2278400898ff6f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毕竟难得有机会\r\n能参加学园的活动嘛，\r\n一定要尽情乐在其中才行♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f46bcb8980127e986a22e2bcc9db49077753c96a18cf19e3b7219e24a30a2be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4e0c2244048ad2b9a2b04f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟大家在一起真开心……\r\n而且小仁也在！\r\n呵呵，必须好好帮忙才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "660a9179141de7c9dab654eb462e8ca6cefead89c9e23b8009d0e575b8ad3ecd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12a3239792fb11731af305ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我记得，以前和家人一起去\r\n法国旅行时……我因为看灯饰\r\n看得太兴奋，还发烧了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "144b49aabe8fc5066fb89392b8d55f3a0ad86fb365efe11341c74b96f6bc2abb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c8c8989d287f0fdc188c84c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光是乐在其中或许我还无法满足。\r\n我想和一路上一起努力过来的……\r\n这五个人获得胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01d21d4da0cdb630945bc88bbbad866cf74992b71c34db07d0328a1370445d00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc5a3deb83f70cd8cef191d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "抓住、超越、化为力量──\r\n直到完全绽放的那天！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95545691fa361bbc0dbec8aac19a7471f265a20c6674c86087b8f48844b342a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3208d4e12e28e70f40a2ebf3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "化朗塔真漂亮。\r\n我也能像那样绽放光芒吗？\r\n……不，我一定要绽放光芒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92016c0288ed389bba8ab964141b9709449687f5bdd6dc209a50dcad97378b7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9eb73b0933140bf80ef1d76d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这些是活动任务！\r\n积极地完成吧！\r\n跟我一起喊～胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "225dad6949ace47c9ec83d411f028bef0728954f94499e4b04b44823dfbc7ba6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:972d53121c071377c8025a09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了！你这么努力，\r\n之后要好好让身体休息喔。\r\n约好啰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e737916a5c06036d9801759102273049d2a0d535864ef865327402241cd34975",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5829ee1bbcdbd2bef49d6350",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定会成功！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7a17d362a85308653059d512d3c62c7a1a019137cda7ccbff914dc6ec2468f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3b9e792c4716417337866fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太好了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0730e92a8deba053152e1d3bf7fe894dd2618c27fe49325439213a1fc330f2c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38d1cb131c94241bfbef4c00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebb3fc1e5fcce5a59bea6d6647879efdb4ac491bee777c3de6d1ad14c5a54ba7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "410002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f9b3e8e61d438b943087b5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebb3fc1e5fcce5a59bea6d6647879efdb4ac491bee777c3de6d1ad14c5a54ba7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
